st:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b003:l023","ordinal":181192,"en":"“When my noble Manas was alive,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b003:l024","ordinal":181193,"en":"We wore the flanks of our horses lean,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b003:l025","ordinal":181194,"en":"Roaming the four corners"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b003:l026","ordinal":181195,"en":"Of the encircling world,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b003:l027","ordinal":181196,"en":"While my lord was alive."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b003:l028","ordinal":181197,"en":"In Beijing of the Kakanchin,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b003:l029","ordinal":181198,"en":"My lord Almam, the leopard, was there;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b003:l030","ordinal":181199,"en":"When I reconnoitered his road,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b003:l031","ordinal":181200,"en":"From its nobles and its khan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b003:l032","ordinal":181201,"en":"From the great city of Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b003:l033","ordinal":181202,"en":"When we rode out to reconnoiter the road,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b003:l034","ordinal":181203,"en":"When we went to demand an answer,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b003:l035","ordinal":181204,"en":"Indeed, Almam and I"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b003:l036","ordinal":181205,"en":"Stayed at Issyk-Köl."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b003:l037","ordinal":181206,"en":"When we faced and besieged"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b003:l038","ordinal":181207,"en":"Beijing, which lay tightly shut,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b003:l039","ordinal":181208,"en":"We lived in this world"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l001","ordinal":181209,"en":"Free by our own will for a time."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l002","ordinal":181210,"en":"Almam the formidable and I"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l003","ordinal":181211,"en":"Stayed in this very place."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l004","ordinal":181212,"en":"At that time dusk came and the sun set;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l005","ordinal":181213,"en":"The spur of that mountain over there,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l006","ordinal":181214,"en":"The nose of the gray ridge,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l007","ordinal":181215,"en":"Was a slope with a spring."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l008","ordinal":181216,"en":"The shrine that the leopard Almam named"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l009","ordinal":181217,"en":"Was called Boz-Uchuk Shrine!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l010","ordinal":181218,"en":"On that broad slope itself"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l011","ordinal":181219,"en":"The people pitched their camp;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l012","ordinal":181220,"en":"The gray hill on this side"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l013","ordinal":181221,"en":"Was the place where your uncle,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l014","ordinal":181222,"en":"Hero Bakai, kept watch."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l015","ordinal":181223,"en":"My land remains, but my people are gone."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l016","ordinal":181224,"en":"Now that my beard is white,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l017","ordinal":181225,"en":"Now that my journey nears its end,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l018","ordinal":181226,"en":"Parted from those valiant men,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l019","ordinal":181227,"en":"I alone remain alive in this filthy world."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l020","ordinal":181228,"en":"I have none of my own age, none my equal,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l021","ordinal":181229,"en":"No hero to ride beside me!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l022","ordinal":181230,"en":"My dear children,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l023","ordinal":181231,"en":"This was a place where a holy father lay;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l024","ordinal":181232,"en":"They called it Boz-Uchuk-Ata."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l025","ordinal":181233,"en":"Boz-Uchuk is a noble shrine—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l026","ordinal":181234,"en":"Let us camp at Boz-Uchuk!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l027","ordinal":181235,"en":"Let us survey the lay of the land;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l028","ordinal":181236,"en":"O calamity-stricken orphans,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l029","ordinal":181237,"en":"Let us gauge the length of the road!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l030","ordinal":181238,"en":"Clearing enemies and traveling the road,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l031","ordinal":181239,"en":"Let us scout that Beijing!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l032","ordinal":181240,"en":"Let us reach the khan of the Kakanchin,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l033","ordinal":181241,"en":"The teeming city of Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l034","ordinal":181242,"en":"Measuring the land as we go."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l035","ordinal":181243,"en":"It has nobles, it has giants,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l036","ordinal":181244,"en":"It has peoples of many kinds;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l037","ordinal":181245,"en":"And among those people"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l038","ordinal":181246,"en":"There is the blue-mottled, gray-bearded great Manchu,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1375:b004:l039","ordinal":181247,"en":"Hero Kongurbai, famed and mighty."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1376:b003:l001","ordinal":181248,"en":"That raging, death-dealing swine"}]
